  "description": "Your everyday adventure buddy: compact, playful, and ready to explore more than just smooth pavement. Chunky fat tires help you feel stable and in control on city streets, gravel paths, and park trails, turning cracks and bumps into something you just roll over and forget about. The assist gives you that fun “push from behind” feeling when you take off or hit a hill, so rides feel lively instead of tiring. Behind the scenes, Element Core uses the same kind of UL 2271‑certified battery packs and UL 2849‑compliant system found across the Pedego line, which means the motor system, battery, and charger have been tested together for electrical and fire safety. That way your adventurous side can explore new routes while your cautious side knows the tech underneath is built to strict, independent safety standards.",
